Add an amount of a merch to a cart. If the merch is already in the cart, the amount is increased. 


\begin{DoxyParams}{Parameters}
{\em store} & the store the cart belongs to \\
\hline
{\em cart\+\_\+num} & number of the cart \\
\hline
{\em name} & name of the merch to add \\
\hline
{\em amount} & how many to add \\
\hline
\end{DoxyParams}
\begin{DoxyReturn}{Returns}
true if added. False, with the cart left unchanged, if the cart does not exist, amount is not positive, or the amount in all carts together would exceed the stock (which includes the merch not existing) 
\end{DoxyReturn}
