bool ioopm\+\_\+cart\+\_\+checkout (\begin{DoxyParamCaption}\item[{\mbox{\hyperlink{webstore_8h_ae9bcdc049693e26e11480d53211d6c44}{ioopm\+\_\+webstore\+\_\+t}} \texorpdfstring{$\ast$}{*}}]{store}{, }\item[{int}]{cart\+\_\+num}{}\end{DoxyParamCaption})}



Buy everything in a cart\+: decrease the stock of every merch in it by the amount in the cart, then remove the cart. Stock is taken from the merch\textquotesingle{}s shelves in the order they are listed, and a shelf that becomes empty is removed. 


\begin{DoxyParams}{Parameters}
{\em store} & the store the cart belongs to \\
\hline
{\em cart\+\_\+num} & number of the cart \\
\hline
\end{DoxyParams}
\begin{DoxyReturn}{Returns}
true if the checkout succeeded. False, with nothing changed, if the cart does not exist or the stock of some merch in it is too small 
\end{DoxyReturn}
